TI  - Use of artificial intelligence‐guided echocardiography to detect cardiac dysfunction and heart valve disease in rural and remote areas: Rationale and design of the AGILE‐echo trial
AU  - Soh, Cheng Hwee
AU  - Wright, Leah
AU  - Baumann, Angus
AU  - Seidel, Bastian
AU  - Yu, Christopher
AU  - Nolan, Mark
AU  - Mylius, Tony
