TI  - Miniature gas-sensing array employed for the discharge fault diagnosis of air-insulated equipment
AU  - Wang, Qiongyuan
AU  - Chu, Jifeng
AU  - Li, Qiulin
AU  - Yang, Aijun
AU  - Yuan, Huan
