TI  - ePRO symptom follow-up of colorectal cancer patients receiving oxaliplatin-based adjuvant chemotherapy is feasible and enhances the quality of patient care: a prospective multicenter study
AU  - Iivanainen, Sanna
AU  - Ravichandra, Ravi
AU  - Jekunen, Antti
AU  - Arokoski, Reetta
AU  - Mentu, Santeri
AU  - Lang, Laura
AU  - Ekström, Jussi
AU  - Virtanen, Henri
